ve extending the third-line wall to the left."}, {"turn": 24, "text": "The 20k's F9 lost 18.3 points and moved the lead from -22.2 to -3.9, so Black briefly had a real chance. The engine's choice was H8. Black's next moves, J6 (3.5 points lost) and G4 (3.7), did not use the opening, and the lead drifted back to double digits."}]}, "audit": {"by": "Sonnet 5.5", "verdict": "clean", "reason": "Everything it ran only reads files, plays moves the player named via mcp__go__play, and parses the current board: current-position-liberties.js lists existing chains and their distinct liberties, and the final script counts empty regions, rebuilds the SGF from the responses, and writes notes. None of it generates, scores, or ranks candidate moves or looks ahead through continuations.", "stop": false}}